 *   MAX_ROUNDS          the auto-rework cap (display + parser env)
 *   GITHUB_REPOSITORY   owner/repo
 *   CONFIG              runner config path (basename → pack agent)
 *   FACTORY_ROOT        legacy verdict parser root
 *   HOME                pack cache root (~/.dmtools/packs/…)
