But wait: the JS side currently uses `tempFile` for pr_comments/issue_comments/threads/comment. If I change to a per-run mktemp -d dir, the `--body-file` operand becomes `<uniqdir>/comment.md` — canon normalizes `[--body-file] [*]` → `[BODY_FILE]`. Fine.

